Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a story I never intended to \Ntell anyone, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Hirai Keita.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do your parents not live with you either?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I have a dad, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's the opposite of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come to this facility?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.58,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They said we couldn't live together anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... \Nbut you'll get used to it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't we sneak out of here \Nwhen evening comes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.35,0:00:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it okay to do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we disappear, \Nnobody's going to worry about us anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Total success!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The teachers were so absorbed in chatting they didn't notice at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the candy shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:00:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gather round, come take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:00:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A Kamishibai? Let's go check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(183.2,48)\fs14}Kamishibai = literally 'paper theater'. \NIt's a traditional Japanese storytelling art that \Ncombines visual illustrations with oral narration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come, come...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gather round, come take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that person?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be someone's mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.83,0:01:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? She's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the story of a boy who wanted to see his mother, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.97,0:01:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a really strange feeling about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is definitely wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That person from earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Keita.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.40,0:01:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know my name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know everything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been watching you all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.10,0:01:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.82,0:02:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If he notices you, it's the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.38,0:02:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.23,0:02:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.99,0:02:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Uahh! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me with those eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.09,0:02:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't come near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.54,0:02:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.10,0:02:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,, But everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.09,0:02:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.65,0:02:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That old man's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.05,0:02:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll never be able to come back from that man's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.49,0:02:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.07,0:03:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,, Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(199.2,92.8)}In this final episode of Season 17, a young boy named Keita, living in a residential facility after being separated from his family, encounters a sinister supernatural entity taking the form of mothers luring children away through a dark kamishibai performance. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.39,0:03:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,234.667)}The episode concludes with a chilling realization about being trapped forever by a mysterious man's dark force, bringing the seasonal horror anthology to a haunting close.
